No. The sources show no monthly fee for the Get Conta. It's a free digital account for your business, with no hidden fees, offered in partnership with Dock IP [1].

With it you can:
- get a free card for online or in-store purchases;
- send and receive money and sell through Pix;
- receive your sales within 2 business days in the morning on your card, if you choose that receiving option;
- make transfers and pay bills;
- withdraw cash at any Banco 24Horas [1].

There is an inactivity fee. If the account has no financial activity for 180 days, R$10.00 is debited monthly until new transactions occur. It is taken only from the available balance, so it won't make your balance negative or harm your CPF/CNPJ [1].

